AuthorDate: 2026-09-09 15:39:04
Commit:     dualface <dualface@gmail.com>
CommitDate: 2026-09-09 17:07:04

    fix(tui): reload scope and overlay config each time Options opens
    
    Opening Options reused App.Session after the first load, so disk
    edits to config.json and .kander-config.json never appeared until
    restart. Reload both files on every open, bind the merged language
    from that read, and drop the old session when either read fails.

=== FILE LEDGER ===
